{"id":"8705fb72e379b21a","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-extendible.md","title":"可无限延伸的树节点","display":"df-extendible — 可无限延伸的树节点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-extendible","aliases":["20-df-extendible"],"display":"df-extendible — 可无限延伸的树节点","chapter":"8","section":"8.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§8.5；extendible nodes 的本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[202],"source_printed_pages":[169],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-extendible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-extendible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extendible — 可无限延伸的树节点"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§8.5；extendible nodes 的本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>202</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为非空集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n\">\\(T\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\tau\\in T\\ \\forall n\\le|\\tau|\\ (\\tau\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\">\\(\\forall\\tau\\in T\\ \\forall n\\le|\\tau|\\ (\\tau\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\)</span>。序列是以自然数或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为定义域的函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\">\\(|\\sigma|=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 对有限序列成立。下列一般字母集分支与二值、自然数字母集的既有分支一致。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in D^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\tau\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\cup D^\\omega),\\\\\n[T]:=\\{X\\in D^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (X\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\},\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{ext}}:=\\{\\sigma\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\n(n\\ge|\\sigma|\\Rightarrow\\exists\\tau\\in T\\cap D^n\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau])\\},\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{path}}:=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [\\sigma\\preceq X]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in D^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\tau\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\cup D^\\omega),\\\\\n[T]:=\\{X\\in D^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (X\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\},\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{ext}}:=\\{\\sigma\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\n(n\\ge|\\sigma|\\Rightarrow\\exists\\tau\\in T\\cap D^n\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau])\\},\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{path}}:=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [\\sigma\\preceq X]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意长延伸与位于一条无限路径上是两种分别定义的性质，不在 Hypothesis 预先使用本定义。路径节点必有任意长延伸；反向在二值或有限分支树上由 König 引理成立，无限分支时会失败，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0287df265ebdc8d6\" href=\"?note=0287df265ebdc8d6\" title=\"20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path\">20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path</a>。空树的两个集合均为空。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.5；印刷 169 / PDF 202。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path","status":"resolved","id":"0287df265ebdc8d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"任意长延伸与位于一条无限路径上是两种分别定义的性质，不在 Hypothesis 预先使用本定义。路径节点必有任意长延伸；反向在二值或有限分支树上由 König 引理成立，无限分支时会失败，见 [[20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path]]。空树的两个集合均为空。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\tau\\in T\\ \\forall n\\le|\\tau|\\ (\\tau\\upharpoonright n\\in T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|\\sigma|=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD^{<\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in D^{<\\omega},\\ \\tau\\in D^{<\\omega}\\cup D^\\omega),\\\\\n[T]:=\\{X\\in D^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (X\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\},\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{ext}}:=\\{\\sigma\\in D^{<\\omega}:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\\n(n\\ge|\\sigma|\\Rightarrow\\exists\\tau\\in T\\cap D^n\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau])\\},\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{path}}:=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [\\sigma\\preceq X]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1805,"backlinks":[{"id":"0287df265ebdc8d6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]。"},{"id":"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。"},{"id":"fe7a8e5db6f59cf9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"49047c938f7aef20","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]。"},{"id":"5d28b1dc93dafdc7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]] — 章 8；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]"}],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","0287df265ebdc8d6"]}